<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back off-market at NZ$6.93/shr.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back off-market at NZ$6.93/shr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Wednesday it bought 199,202 shares on Tuesday from its core shareholders Bell Atlantic Holdings and Ameritech Holdings at NZ$6.93 per share as part of its $1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>The current phase of the buyback is expected to continue until the company announces it is completed.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
